1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,141
You open the patient register to enrol
a person presenting to the clinic.

2
00:00:04,141 --> 00:00:07,488
You enter their full name, age,
home village, and province.

3
00:00:07,488 --> 00:00:11,345
Any known allergy is recorded here
so that every department sees it.

4
00:00:11,345 --> 00:00:15,203
Once saved, the system assigns a
permanent hospital number for life.

5
00:00:15,203 --> 00:00:19,514
You open the printable patient card to
hand to the patient for their visits.

6
00:00:19,514 --> 00:00:25,244
Every patient record is stored safely in
the clinic database, ready for immediate
access during care.
